"kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.0.61","summary":"Hello!A quick optimization update:GPU options and automatic detection when no GPUOptimization of levels (occlusion & small tweaks)Fix character animation's transitions and false statesFix camera FOV blend at end of cinematicsFix lateral/vertical throw of Guide","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:42:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1846651706680687","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.0.60","summary":"Hi, everyone!Split Brain Samsara Demo will be part of the upcoming STEAM NEXT FEST!The event starts next Monday, and we’ve just updated the game’s demo! Many of you have already played it, but it would help us out a lot if you could give it another try! Quite a few things have changed (thanks to all your feedback—once again!), and new features have been added (like a “Need a hint?” button! Yes, really!). Giving it another playthrough before the event starts would help us make sure this version i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:09:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1845383656393774","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update v0.0.54","summary":"Hi! First of all, thanks for all the feedback!We’ll admit it—we were a little stressed about this playtest update. Lots of new levels, new mechanics, and puzzles, but your feedback has been incredible! The overall structure of Samsara is taking shape, and it’s getting better with your help, so thanks again!That certainly didn’t stop us from discovering plenty of little bugs and other issues that we’ve (finally?) fixed! Here is the long detailed list (we think we’ve included everything):Character","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T15:22:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1844751498220474","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update 0.0.52","summary":"Hey, big brains! We’re back with a major update to the Split Brain Samsara playtest!First off, we’d like to thank everyone who participated in the playtest—especially those who sent us written feedback! Your comments have really helped us improve the game, fix bugs, and refine the overall experience! Today, we’re updating the playtest version, get ready to discover not 1, not 2, but 3 NEW LEVELS! Of course, you’ll be able to pick up where you left off and see what Samsara has in store for you… w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T07:08:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1842212951300220","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtests are now OPEN","summary":"Hello, everyone! Summer is slowly coming to an end, and Split Brain Samsara continues to grow! We hope you’ve had a chance to try out and enjoy the new version of the demo—the game’s structure is starting to take shape. We want to move away from the “Level Selection” format of the first Split Brain and offer you a seamless experience. You’ll be able to explore at your own pace and return to previous levels (and yes, there will be a reason to do so ). And if you’d like to dive deeper into the gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T14:37:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300220","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1840944183776609","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"update","title":"Demo Major Update","summary":"Split Brain Samsara demo has its FIRST BIG UPDATE!Since last time, we made huge progress on the game and it felt wrong to let the demo as it was, so we made this update so the demo is containing all new elements we added in the last weeks !Especially a tutorial, some cinematics and a Saving System !We hope you will enjoy it even more now!Feel free to let us know what you think about it, either on Steam or on our Discord !And as usual don’t forget to leave a review of the demo—it helps us a lot!A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T12:26:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1834602721190685","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.0.28","summary":"Hello!A small patch mainly to fix the annoying infinite load on start bug Fix infinite load on start issue (hopefully)Fix thrown player sounds spatialization heard by the other playerFix visual effect full reset when leaving back to main menu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T13:38:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721190685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1834602721187394","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.7","summary":"Hello!A patch that fixes bugs, adds a restart option, and makes a major change to the planet puzzle in Level 2!Moved a Post-it note in Level 1Added a checkpoint in the first mental zoneChanged the logic and solution for the “Planet” puzzle in Level 2Modified the layout of the second mental zoneLarger plant in the second mental zoneImprovement: Make plants/flowers harder to miss when thrown into themFix: Restart button now worksFixed a collider issue with a box in Level 2Add some SFXSee you soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T12:55:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187394","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1833968530891731","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.0.26","summary":"Hello!A quick update that improves gamepad, lightning and adding new clues. Menu Gamepad navigation improvementLevel 1 & 2 more elements to help find solutionLevel 2 lights improvementSee you soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T16:52:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530891731","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4370210-1833968530888770","game_id":"steam-4370210","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO is now AVAILABLE","summary":"Hi, everyone! The Split Brain Samsara demo is NOW AVAILABLE!Get ready to explore the massive Samsara structure, discover your new powers, and put your brain skills to the test to reach the end! Plus, Split Brain Samsara is part of the Cerebral Showcase, a major event for logic games that we’re proud to be a part of! Don’t forget to leave a review of the demo—it helps us a lot!Thanks again to all the playtesters for their feedback. See you soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T16:36:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888770","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4370210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4370210":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4370210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4693560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4370210","app_id":4370210,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c5a65b6df049bc472829ea824e67a4925750a4908bc599c4da0cba054c0db72b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"당신과 당신 친구는 같은 몸 안에 갇혔습니다!\r\n\r\n이 협동 모험에서 같은 캐릭터를 조작하는 법을 익히고, 정신적인 영역을 탐험하고, 삼사라라는 거대 구조물에 숨겨진 음모를 밝혀내세요! 소통이 핵심입니다!","publishers":[{"name":"Kusa Games","creator_clan_account_id":45670617}],"developers":[{"name":"Kusa Games","creator_clan_account_id":45670617}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795716000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo Out","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792742997","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":